oshi, Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces. Partly cloudy conditions will prevail in the Himalayan and hilly areas of Lumbini, Karnali and Sudurpashchim Provinces, as well as in the Terai areas of the country. Moderate rainfall is likely at a few places in the Himalayan and hilly areas of Koshi and Bagmati Provinces, and light rainfall is likely at one or two places in the hilly areas of Gandaki, Lumbini, Karnali and Sudurpashchim Provinces. Light rainfall is likely at one or two places in the Terai areas of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki and Lumbini Provinces.      "}}]}],"model_issued":[]}